 Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Jump</color> to cast this skill, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and Hsin is in mid-air, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.\nConsume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thund