-  "Skill_1006102_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air.\n\nIf Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, She turns into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color>. \n- While turned into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> and out of combat, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>. With <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>, Hsin can enter the target's aggro range without triggering combat. <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color> is removed when Hsin enters combat, is switched out, or ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form by having environmental, gameplay, or feature interactions.\n- While turned into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> and out of combat, Hsin restores {0} of Max HP every {1}s.\n- Taking damage, failing to perform a <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> with directional input while on the ground, or <color=Highlight>Dodging</color> in mid-air will end the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. Switching to another Resonator or {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tapping PC=pressing Gamepad=pressing} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>, which also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n- The Dash state continuously consumes STA when Hsin is in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> is disabled when Hsin is in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006102_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air.\n\nIf Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, she turns into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color>. \n- While in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and out of combat, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>. With <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>, Hsin can enter the target's aggro range without triggering combat. <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color> is removed when Hsin enters combat, is switched out, or ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form by having environmental, gameplay, or feature interactions.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and out of combat, Hsin restores {0} of Max HP every {1}s.\n- Taking damage, failing to perform a <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> with directional input while on the ground, or <color=Highlight>Dodging</color> in mid-air will end the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. Switching to another Resonator or {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tapping PC=pressing Gamepad=pressing} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>, which also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n- The Dash state continuously consumes STA when Hsin is in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> is disabled when Hsin is in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006102_SkillName": "Heartward by Moon",
   "Skill_1006102_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold a directional key while casting this skill to turn Hsin into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> after a short time. While out of combat, She restores a certain amount of HP every 3s.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006103_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Formshift</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Formshift</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin turns into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, engaging in <color=Highlight>quest dialogue</color>, performing an <color=Highlight>environmental interaction with an animation</color>, or using a <color=Highlight>Utility</color> switches Hsin back to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> to perform the corresponding action.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in the deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in mid-air.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Pillars Across Heaven</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nHsin returns to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Edict</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> for {2}s. The effect cannot exceed <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.\nAfter the active Resonator in the team deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes <color=Highlight>Edict</color> in the following {1}s to trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the duration:\n- When <color=Highlight>Edict</color> is consumed, summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>. \n- <color=Highlight>Edict</color> can be automatically consumed up to 1 stack per second.\n- Damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- When Hsin is knocked out, all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are removed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heart Manifest</color></size>\nIncreases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> has not been unlocked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Answering</color></size>\nHsin temporarily reverts to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Illumining</color></size>\nHsin turns back into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006103_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Formshift</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Formshift</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin switches to <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, engaging in <color=Highlight>quest dialogue</color>, performing an <color=Highlight>environmental interaction with an animation</color>, or using a <color=Highlight>Utility</color> switches Hsin back to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> to perform the corresponding action.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in mid-air.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Pillars Across Heaven</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nHsin returns to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Edict</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> for {2}s. The effect cannot exceed <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.\nAfter the active Resonator in the team deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes <color=Highlight>Edict</color> in the following {1}s to trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the duration:\n- When <color=Highlight>Edict</color> is consumed, summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>. \n- <color=Highlight>Edict</color> can be automatically consumed up to 1 stack per second.\n- Damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- When Hsin is knocked out, all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are removed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heart Manifest</color></size>\nIncreases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> is locked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Answering</color></size>\nHsin temporarily reverts to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Illumining</color></size>\nHsin turns back into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.",
   "Skill_1006103_SkillName": "Nexus Alight",
   "Skill_1006103_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Liberation</color></size>\nEnter <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color></size>\nDeal massive <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> and return Hsin to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Coordinated Attack</color></size>\nAfter <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> is cast, Hsin performs Coordinated Attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006104_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, when Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color>, Her ATK is increased by {0} for {1}s. Switching to another Resonator or Resonance Mode ends this effect.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, Hsin gains {2} Electro DMG Bonus, stacking up to {3} times. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, when Rover: Electro casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Thunderous Fury</color>, both Hsin and Rover: Electro gain {6} Electro DMG Bonus for {7}s.\nThis effect resets when a Resonator is added to the team or when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
   "Skill_1006104_SkillName": "Tides of Succession",
   "Skill_1006104_SkillResume": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Hsin's ATK is increased for a certain time after casting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Intro Skill</color>.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color>, Hsin deals more Electro DMG. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, while in combat, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, Hsin and Rover: Electro deal more Electro DMG.",
-  "Skill_1006105_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, the maximum stacks of the <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> effect on Resonators in the team are increased by {0}. When a Resonator in the team triggers <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, all Resonators in the team gain <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> for {2}s. This effect does not stack.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color> and Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, Hsin gains 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> after Resonators in the team other than Hsin inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, stacking up to {1} times.\nWhile Hsin is in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, when targets within a certain range have 0 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, inflict 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the targets. If <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> on Hsin reaches the stack limit, Hsin also inflicts <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> on the targets:\n- When Hsin inflicts <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> on the target, She also inflicts <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target to the stack limit, up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> is active, if the maximum stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target are increased, Hsin will inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target to the stack limit again, up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> will be removed when the target leaves the designated range around Hsin.\nExiting the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state or switching Resonance Mode removes the effects mentioned above.",
+  "Skill_1006105_SkillDescribe": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, the maximum stacks of the <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> effect on Resonators in the team are increased by {0}. When a Resonator in the team triggers <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, all Resonators in the team gain <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> for {2}s. This effect does not stack.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color> and Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, Hsin gains 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> after Resonators in the team other than Hsin inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, stacking up to {1} times.\nWhile Hsin is in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, when targets within a certain range have 0 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>, inflict 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the targets. If <color=Highlight>Thunderglow</color> on Hsin reaches the stack limit, Hsin also inflicts <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> on the targets:\n- When Hsin inflicts <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> on the target, She also inflicts <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target to the stack limit, up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- When <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> is active, if the maximum stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target is increased, Hsin will inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target to the stack limit again, up to {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> will be removed when the target leaves the designated range around Hsin.\nExiting the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state or switching Resonance Mode removes the aforementioned effects.",
   "Skill_1006105_SkillName": "Gleaning Simple Joys",
   "Skill_1006105_SkillResume": "While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> stacks on Resonators in the team are increased.\n\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, for a certain time after Hsin casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>, She inflicts <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> on targets within a certain range to the stack limit.",
-  "Skill_1006106_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>) or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>).\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThe skill becomes available when in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThe skill becomes available when in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006106_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>) or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>).\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006106_SkillName": "Glance on a Whim",
   "Skill_1006106_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Enhanced Intro Skill</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, each time the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> is triggered, this <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> and the next become <color=Highlight>Enhanced Intro Skill</color>, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006107_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Forms Born of Heart</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color> reaches {0} points, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast the skill at the cost of STA and {0} points of <color=Highlight><te href=131117>Answering Heart</te></color>. Hsin is immune to interruption during the action, and deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color>. This <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> consumes <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color> to become <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight><te href=131114>Resolution of Wishes</te></color> can only be gained once every {16}s.\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color>, if Hsin is not in the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state, unlock <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> reaches 0 during the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast the skill at the cost of STA, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color>. This <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> consumes <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color> to become <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color>, dealing greater DMG. <color=Highlight><te href=131115>Law of Heaven</te></color> can only be gained once every {16}s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color> ends the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state and unlocks <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Hsin's <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> reaches {1} points and She is on the ground, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to surrounding targets, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mechanism Dominion</color></size>\nThe <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state lasts {2}s.\nWhile this state is active, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> hits a target, <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color> is consumed if Hsin is the active Resonator.\nExiting <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> clears <color=Highlight><te href=131118>Illumining Heart</te></color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Unison</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- Hsin can trigger <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, but not in Co-op Mode.\n- After casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color>, the next <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> grants Hsin <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color> for {17}s.\n- When Hsin triggers <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color>, She gains <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast this time is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\nWhen Hsin casts an <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> without triggering <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> while holding <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, She consumes <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color> instead, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\n- The effects on Hsin mentioned above are removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> sends Hsin directly into the <color=Highlight><te href=131116>Mechanism Dominion</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Hsin gains the following effects:\n- When Hsin enters combat, targets within a certain range do not lose <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks when it's triggered.\n- After Resonators in the team inflict <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> to a target, every <SapTag=4>{4}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=4} of <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> inflicted grants Hsin <SapTag=6>{6}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=6} of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, stacking up to {5} times, and consumes all <color=Highlight><te href=150806>Electro Rage</te></color> stacks from that target. <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.\n- At the last stage of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, Hsin actively triggers 1 instance of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG on the targets. Its DMG Multiplier is equal to {9} x (the number of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> stacks on Hsin) x (the <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> stacks).\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early will end the above effects early.\nSome time after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</color>, Hsin consumes all remaining stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>.\nWhen Hsin has at least {24} stacks of <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> stagnates nearby targets during the action.\n- After casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, inflict <SapTag=E>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on nearby targets within a certain range. It also makes <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> inflict <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on hit targets, up to <SapTag=A>{12}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=A}. Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> again resets this count. Switching Resonance Mode removes it.\n<color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color> inflict <SapTag=E>{18}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target hit. <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, and <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color> inflict <SapTag=F>{19}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=F} of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color> on the target hit.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison</color></size>\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> with <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, switching to another Resonator will remove Hsin's <color=Highlight>Unison</color> to trigger Hsin's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. If Hsin has full Concerto Energy and <color=Highlight>Unison</color> at the same time, only <color=Highlight>Unison</color> is consumed to trigger the effect.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Response</color></size>\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color> and the active Resonator in the team has <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>, Hsin triggers <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> when She is switched in and casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, granting <SapTag=G>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> to all Resonators in the team for {21}s.\nHsin can only grant up to <SapTag=G>{20}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> in this way.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Unison Boon</color></size>\nOnly the Resonators who can trigger Unison Reponse can gain this effect. Each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators who can trigger <color=Highlight><te href=131112>Unison Response</te></color> in the team by {22}, stacking up to {23} times.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Heart</color></size>\nCan hold up to {0} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\nCasting <co