-  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to perform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
