   "Term131117_Title": "Answering Heart",
-  "Term131118_Desc": "Can hold up to {1} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> directly sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state and grants {10} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, when the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> generated by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> is collapsed by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, gain {11} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if Hsin is the active Resonator. This effect can only be triggered once before the next cast of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> resets it, and is disabled when switched to the other Resonance Mode.",
+  "Term131118_Desc": "Can hold up to {1} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and not in the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color> directly sends Hsin into the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state and grants {10} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color>, when the <color=Highlight>Modular Heartlock</color> generated by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</color> is collapsed by <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</color>, <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, additionally gain {11} points of <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> if Hsin is the active Resonator in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> but not in the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state. This effect can only be triggered once before the next cast of <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</color> resets it, and is disabled when switched to the other Resonance Mode.",
